    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I want a single DRAGON model that includes RNA-seq, DNA methylation and proteomics together for our 70 ovarian tumors. I'm not sure whether my PI will want it in the main text."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"I want a single DRAGON model that includes RNA-seq, DNA methylation and proteomics together for our 70 ovarian tumors.\" -- I couldn't match this to anything a registered NetZoo workflow produces or lets you set. DRAGON gives: one undirected partial-correlation network within and between two matched omics layers (any two, e.g. expression and methylation), across all samples. A p-value and a Benjamini-Hochberg adjusted p-value for every edge (adjusted within each layer and across the layers), to filter edges by significance.\n\nI couldn't match this to a result any registered NetZoo workflow produces, so none is offered.\n\nRegistered workflows that take the kind of data you described: PANDA, PUMA, LIONESS-PANDA, LIONESS-PUMA, LIONESS-COEXPRESSION, COBRA, DRAGON, LIONESS-DRAGON, OTTER, GIRAFFE, BONOBO. Tell me if one of them gives what you meant, or which result you need.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
  ],
